blocks.en:
Sparsity-aware adaptive gating conditions the shared block’s gates on where events fire;
on DSEC it alone does not degrade as inference steps grow past the trained
range, leaving recursion depth a usable compute knob.

blocks.zh:
平面感知的适应性 标点条件 共享的街区的大门 事发地点;
仅凭DSEC,它不会因为推论逐渐超越训练有素的人而退化
范围,使复发深度成为可用的计算键。
